+\section*{Conflicting BLAME evidence and common recovery}
+Use $n=5$, $f=2$, with Alice at term 0 and Bob at term 1. A valid old honest
+BLAME share for Alice already exists. At time 0, $P$ receives $\BC_{(e,1)}$
+and freezes; Caro receives it at $\Delta$. Byzantine members complete the
+withheld $\BC_{(e,0)}$ at Caro at $3\Delta/2$; its relay reaches $P$ at
+$5\Delta/2$. Thus the two honest STATUS snapshots differ. A single BLAME
+share would not freeze either node.
+
