+\node[rrbox,draw=rrRed!70,fill=rrRed!4,text width=3.6cm,minimum height=1.5cm] (pstatus) at (2.25,1.1)
+ {\textbf{$P$: snapshot at $\Delta$}\\proofs: $\{\BC_{(e,1)}\}$\\plus its QC set};
